WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.205
The Eagle, and its pillars.

00:02.905 --> 00:06.617
The dark fingers in the middle are the Pillars of Creation.

00:07.067 --> 00:18.356
The Hubble telescope made them famous in 1995, and the Webb telescope has since looked through their dust in infrared light and found newborn stars inside.

00:18.806 --> 00:22.127
This picture is from the ground, in visible light.
